'NOTE\\wNOTES (UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED):\\n\\n1. CAD MODEL ________
___ REV. __ IS\\n    REQUIRED TO COMPLETE PRODUCT\\n    DEFINITION.\\n
\\n2. DIRECTLY-TOLERANCED DIMENSIONS\\n    AND BASIC DIMENSIONS DEFINE
D ON\\n    THE DRAWING TAKE PRECEDENCE\\n    OVER DIMENSIONAL DATA DEF
INED BY\\n    THE MODEL. OBTAIN ALL OTHER\\n    DIMENSIONAL DATA FROM 
THE MODEL.\\n    THE MODEL REPRESENTS BASIC\\n    DIMENSIONAL DATA UNL
ESS\\n    OTHERWISE SPECIFIED.\\n\\n3. APPLICABLE STANDARDS:\\n    ASM
